        "content": "## Pipeline A — Master Onboarding Orchestrator\n\n1. Webhook ingress (POST /capstone-onboarding)\n2. SQL_CheckDuplicates → Is Duplicate? (stop on duplicate email)\n3. SQL_CreateProfile + SQL_CreateChecklist\n4. Route_Department → IT (Pipeline B) or HR (Pipeline C) worker\n5. Slack approval → Wait (webhook resume, 2h timeout) → SQL_UpdateApproval\n\nSet Pipeline D as this workflow's Error Workflow after publishing D.",
